{"code":200,"message":"success","data":{"title":"工会","update_time":"2025-04-24T00:00:00","content":"<p style=\"text-indent: 24pt; text-align: center; line-height: 1.5;\"><img src=\"http://www2.sxjzit.edu.cn:8082/zhglxt/profile/cms/upload/2025/04/24/gh_20250424113131A967.webp\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"width: 30%;\"></p><p style=\"text-indent: 24pt; text-align: left; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">参与民主管理，发挥桥梁纽带作用，根据《工会法》等相关法律，在维护学校总体利益的同时，维护教职工的合法权益及女教职工的特殊利益。</span></p><p style=\"text-indent: 21pt; text-align: left; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">（一）负责学校工会会员代表大会的筹备组织和日常工作。</span></p><p style=\"text-indent: 21pt; text-align: left; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">（二）做好教代会的筹备组织和提案收集工作，负责教代会的日常工作。 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-indent: 21pt; text-align: left; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">（三）围绕学校工作大局，贯彻执行教职工代表大会和工会会员代表大会确定的方针、任务和作出的决议。</span></p><p style=\"text-indent: 21pt; text-align: left; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">（四）做好工会系统先进的推荐、评选工作。</span></p><p style=\"text-indent: 21pt; text-align: left; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">（五）深入基层听取教职工的意见和诉求，做好职工的来信来访和调解劳动争议等工作。</span></p><p style=\"text-indent: 21pt; text-align: left; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">（六）负责会员的入会、退会、转接和会籍管理。</span></p><p style=\"text-indent: 21pt; text-align: left; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">（七）负责会员会费的收缴，严格工会经费的使用管理。</span></p><p style=\"text-indent: 21pt; text-align: left; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">（八）密切联系群众，维护教职工的合法权益和女教职工的特定合法权益。 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-indent: 21pt; text-align: left; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">（九）组织开展有益于教职工身心健康的文娱体育活动。</span></p><p style=\"text-indent: 21pt; text-align: left; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">（十）会同有关部门做好职工劳动竞赛工作。 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-indent: 21pt; text-align: left; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">（十一）做好集体福利及职工慰问工作。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"> &nbsp; （十二）不断改进和加强工会自身建设。</span></p>","href":"","image_url":"https://www2.sxjzit.edu.cn:8082/zhglxt/profile/upload/2025/04/24/gh_20250424113146A968.webp"},"timestamp":1790737103491,"executeTime":7}